# Appwrite Provider

The Appwrite provider is used to manage resources on [Appwrite](https://appwrite.io). It supports both Appwrite Cloud and self-hosted Community Edition instances.

## Authentication

The provider requires an API key with appropriate scopes for the resources you want to manage. You can configure credentials directly in the provider block or via environment variables.

